      "explanation_markdown": "**Given.** Producers (1st level) have $1000\\,\\text{J}$; only $10\\%$ passes to each next level.\n\n**Step 1 — Primary consumers (2nd level).** $1000 \\times 0.1 = 100\\,\\text{J}$.\n\n**Step 2 — Secondary consumers (3rd level).** $100 \\times 0.1 = 10\\,\\text{J}$, i.e. $1000 \\times 0.1 \\times 0.1$.\n\n**Answer.** $10\\,\\text{J}$.",
